    character: {fileID: -7806072261684390948, guid: c950a3ec4fd9d7a4ca4f72fcce589c4c, type: 3}
    text: Even so, some small fraction within me still calls out for someone.
    textThai: "\u0E41\u0E21\u0E49\u0E08\u0E30\u0E40\u0E1B\u0E47\u0E19\u0E40\u0E0A\u0E48\u0E19\u0E19\u0E31\u0E49\u0E19
